{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgtK2SHSHsiSXRjCk34pw","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The loop entry is gradual, not abrupt. Before the dense loop, the reasoning already turns into short \"Wait.\" lines that re-check the same facts, often with indentation that grows line by line (nested \"*   Wait, ...\" bullets), until a line is reproduced verbatim and the cycle locks in. So the verbatim loop is the end state of an escalating self-doubt spiral. Two mechanisms are involved: what drives the excessive \"Wait\"/re-check behaviour, and what turns re-checks into exact copies. I'll quantify the spiral with \"Wait\" density per 1,000 tokens (estimated from character positions) in successive windows, for finished versus cut answers. If cut answers show steadily rising doubt before the loop while finished ones stay flat, the self-reinforcing doubt dynamic is a plausible target alongside the copy mechanism.\n\n```python\n# 'Wait' density per 1k tokens by position bin, finished vs cut (char-based token estimate ~2.43 chars/token)\ndef wait_density(t, nbins=12, binchars=2430):\n    out=[]\n    for b in range(nbins):\n        seg=t[b*binchars:(b+1)*binchars]\n        out.append(len(re.findall(r'\\bWait\\b', seg)) if len(seg)>binchars*0.8 else np.nan)\n    return out\nWC=np.array([wait_density(t) for i,t in cut_samples]); WF=np.array([wait_density(t[:t.find('</think>')]) for i,t in fin])\nprint('bins (k tokens):', list(range(1,13)))\nprint('cut     :', np.round(np.nanmean(WC,0),1))\nprint('finished:', np.round(np.nanmean(WF,0),1), ' n per bin', (~np.isnan(WF)).sum(0))\n# same for the early part only: does early Wait density predict cut within level strata?\nearly_w = np.nanmean(WC[:,:2],1); early_wf=np.nanmean(WF[:,:2],1)\nprint('first 2k tokens Wait/1k: cut %.1f  finished %.1f'%(np.nanmean(early_w), np.nanmean(early_wf)))\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2514,"cache_read_input_tokens":99193,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2514},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"62565e73-02d6-44c2-a0dc-003a43867133","uuid":"77af1e96-f42e-42cc-81f9-01315eb97e69","timestamp":"2026-11-10T00:37:09.221Z","request_id":"req_011CgtK2RHABLmrKWzxf4v64"}
